      "statement": "limedl-core's Metalink subsystem is the metalink module, which re-exports parse_metalink_xml, parse_metalink_headers, MirrorPool/MirrorLease/MirrorStatusSnapshot, probe_mirrors, MirrorScoringConfig/calculate_mirror_score and the document/types.",
