      "statement": "parse_metalink_xml rejects payloads over 10 MiB and documents with no <file> entries, sanitizes the file name to a basename, normalizes priority so 1 is highest (explicit priority or inverted preference), routes bittorrent/non-HTTP URLs to metaurls and HTTP(S) URLs to resources, and recognizes only SHA-256/SHA-512/BLAKE3.",
